  "description": {
    "text": "The 2007 Gym Final, seven district tournaments from 20 May to 3 June 2007, was played as a Swiss draw with 30-card decks, three Prize cards and a ten-minute time limit. The winner of each league won a place in the final tournament of Battle Road Summer 2007 and the 2007 gold Victory Medal in an acrylic plaque. The medal itself went on being given at Official Gym events through 2008, so only the plaque marks a Gym Final copy.",
